## Recommended Mitigation Steps
The recommendation to fix this problem is to account for the fees on the cash side of the equation, instead of accounting for the fees on the percentage side.
In this way, the formula will compute the exact amount of credit for the exact amount of cash that is taken from the CreditBuyer.

