## Recommended Mitigation Steps
Since the compensate mechanism doesn't charge any fees other than the fragmentationFee, I'd recommend implementing a minimum partial repayment, for example, 20% of the totalDebt, and, if the borrower decides to pay less than the minimum, charge the fragmentationFee. 
- In this way, malicious borrowers will be disincentivized from fragmentating the Credit into hundreds or thousands of small credits, and honest borrowers can opt to partially repay at least the minimum amount without paying fragmentationFees.





