```

- If Size deploys to mainnet before the V3.1 upgrade, Size can include both the current and the new (see above) functionality in their contracts and pass a flag to indicate whether or not the Aave pool has been upgraded to v3.1. If it has, then the new functionality should be utilized. Alternatively, Size can also simply document this future issue and then perform an upgrade to introduce this new functionality when Aave upgrades to v3.1.


