```
this wouldn't have been possible had there been no `borrow offer` submitted by `bob`, the action would have revert due to this line of code 👇
```
// validate borrower
        if (borrowOffer.isNull()) {
            revert Errors.INVALID_BORROW_OFFER(borrower);
        }
