# Vulnerability details

## Impact
The `executeLiquidateWithReplacement` function in [LiquidateWithReplacement.sol#L149-L151](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-size/blob/8850e25fb088898e9cf86f9be1c401ad155bea86/src/libraries/actions/LiquidateWithReplacement.sol#L149-L151)

The `debtPosition` is updated with the new borrower and future value, but the `dueDate` is not updated. This means the new borrower will have a debt position with the same due date as the original borrower, which may differ from the intended behavior.
```solidity
debtPosition.borrower = params.borrower;
debtPosition.futureValue = debtPositionCopy.futureValue;
debtPosition.liquidityIndexAtRepayment = 0;
```
The `dueDate` should also be updated to reflect the new borrower's loan term. Without updating the `dueDate`, the new borrower may have a shorter or longer loan term than intended, which could lead to unexpected behavior in the protocol.

## Proof of Concept
The [liquidateWithReplacement function in Size.sol](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-size/blob/8850e25fb088898e9cf86f9be1c401ad155bea86/src/Size.sol#L229-L244)
```solidity
function liquidateWithReplacement(LiquidateWithReplacementParams calldata params)
    external
    payable
    override(ISize)
    whenNotPaused
    onlyRole(KEEPER_ROLE)
    returns (uint256 liquidatorProfitCollateralToken, uint256 liquidatorProfitBorrowToken)
{
    state.validateLiquidateWithReplacement(params);
    uint256 amount;
    (amount, liquidatorProfitCollateralToken, liquidatorProfitBorrowToken) =
        state.executeLiquidateWithReplacement(params);
    state.validateUserIsNotBelowOpeningLimitBorrowCR(params.borrower);
    state.validateMinimumCollateralProfit(params, liquidatorProfitCollateralToken);
    state.validateVariablePoolHasEnoughLiquidity(amount);
}
```
The [executeLiquidateWithReplacement function in LiquidateWithReplacement.sol](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-size/blob/8850e25fb088898e9cf86f9be1c401ad155bea86/src/libraries/actions/LiquidateWithReplacement.sol#L126-L151)
```solidity
function executeLiquidateWithReplacement(State storage state, LiquidateWithReplacementParams calldata params)
    external
    returns (uint256 issuanceValue, uint256 liquidatorProfitCollateralToken, uint256 liquidatorProfitBorrowToken)
{
    // ...

    DebtPosition storage debtPosition = state.getDebtPosition(params.debtPositionId);
    DebtPosition memory debtPositionCopy = debtPosition;
    BorrowOffer storage borrowOffer = state.data.users[params.borrower].borrowOffer;
    uint256 tenor = debtPositionCopy.dueDate - block.timestamp;

    // ...

    debtPosition.borrower = params.borrower;
    debtPosition.futureValue = debtPositionCopy.futureValue;
    debtPosition.liquidityIndexAtRepayment = 0;

    // ...
