            cashAmountIn = params.amount;
```

https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-size/blob/8850e25fb088898e9cf86f9be1c401ad155bea86/src/libraries/actions/BuyCreditMarket.sol#L195
```solidity 
        state.data.borrowAToken.transferFrom(
            msg.sender,
            borrower,
            cashAmountIn - fees 
        );
```

In `liquidateWithReplacement()` there is no check like seen in buyCreditMarket() which checks that the new loan amount (issuanceValue) is not lower than the `riskConfig.minimumCreditBorrowAToken` before the transfer of the borrowAtoken. 

https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-size/blob/8850e25fb088898e9cf86f9be1c401ad155bea86/src/libraries/actions/LiquidateWithReplacement.sol#L146C1-L161C93
