# Vulnerability details

## Impact
The `borrowAToken` cap is mostly ineffective when depositing USDC via `multicall`. As a result, protocol risk can grow beyond the risk parameters set by the admin.

The issue exists because `Multicall.sol` checks `state.data.borrowAToken.balanceOf(address(this))` which is the incorrect value.

## Proof of Concept

I created a test to reproduce this issue:

```
